--- patch49: thumbnail head cutoff fix
--- File: src/app/jobs/[id]/results/page.tsx
--- Line 453

CHANGE:
  className="w-full h-full object-cover"
TO:
  className="w-full h-full object-cover object-top"

WHY:
  Thumbnail grid uses aspect-[3/4] container. Generated shots are 9:16.
  Default object-cover centers vertically — cuts head AND shoes.
  object-top pins image to top of container → head always visible in thumbnail.
  Applies to all shot types (M01-M05).
